{"title":"2010 IMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/904cf01fc90d3288a1d01c897e21ca7ff5f4a9ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb{R}\\rightarrow\\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> such that for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/b/39b5c9755a11dfd9dea1da1dcd236e268bad8675.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y\\in\\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" /> the following equality holds \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/4/3d4891a7cfcaaa889eaf129d258eea584b544310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\left\\lfloor x\\right\\rfloor y)=f(x)\\left\\lfloor f(y)\\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"174\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/72002e3e660c30e34eaf1a18e0092d7c77d8b790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor a\\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"22\" height=\"19\" /> is greatest integer not greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/e/45ef9cdc7c7d46920eac603663914e0d9261a99b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p><i>Author: Pierre Bornsztein, France </i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Put <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/c/08cc55a3a19c9f8cf005f17391db8ed355d2909c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82d0e714dd3855ef2e740b789ae984e1d7cd5f39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/0/6e00ad19120ca463bf74b1f50357710d7550bd22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor f(0) \\rfloor=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d534b942086dae501cbdce030206adb87567bb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bullet$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/0/6e00ad19120ca463bf74b1f50357710d7550bd22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor f(0) \\rfloor=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"19\" />, putting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec89f09c84538ec43930ca5d8e5e0957e2000822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/0/7d0afa25ff2cf71068128784c0395c53b3141dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=f(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />, that is f is constant. \nSubstituing in the original equation we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fcd141031f2302bdc1503d93416edfb5927878b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=0, \\ \\forall x \\in \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf26598f405e9434a74040b532ca83ee2c2eecb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=a, \\ \\forall x \\in \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/f/5ef245df3545f7c493175000a874fcc3fb2e3071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\in [1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d534b942086dae501cbdce030206adb87567bb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bullet$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82d0e714dd3855ef2e740b789ae984e1d7cd5f39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, putting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/5/915f1781caa8b3e0eddafe7a445019f06178da22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d358367015e5ceeb10a72c78d0b627d586f3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/c/22c74192b538731877d8233517d2d466a223c45c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor f(1) \\rfloor=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d358367015e5ceeb10a72c78d0b627d586f3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, we set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/5/d451843c538a271e026b621762c0eab90f2bf56a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)=0 \\ \\forall y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />, which is a solution.\n</p><p><br />\nFor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/c/22c74192b538731877d8233517d2d466a223c45c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor f(1) \\rfloor=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"19\" />, setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/b/0eb3d87d4e5b5fd2125a91d2063efd36f24b7595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\lfloor x \\rfloor)=f(x), \\ (*)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"146\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Putting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/7/947566789d2dd75d59374d46cc538a0273d650ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2, y=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"97\" height=\"37\" /> to the original we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34b827e3df21421c59048d51807e27b9ab421254.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=f(2)\\lfloor f(\\frac{1}{2}) \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"143\" height=\"37\" />.\nHowever, from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d02e715e7f7195675151570530c5b62ba7b2744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(*)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/6/436ef15537a7329d15fbc810ff6fe0eed2e43d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\frac{1}{2})=f(0)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"129\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d358367015e5ceeb10a72c78d0b627d586f3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> which contradicts the fact <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/c/22c74192b538731877d8233517d2d466a223c45c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor f(1) \\rfloor=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/666661ef393ab5c6ed4a4bdb2fe7c95c1d98b0d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=0, \\ \\forall x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/1/a11bb2e1059794cac36d61895d2f1c2ddb159f6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=a, \\ \\forall x, \\ a \\in [1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />. ( By socrates<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=10045&amp;\">[1]</a>)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec89f09c84538ec43930ca5d8e5e0957e2000822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> we have    <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/a/ffa5de96bfbb448541eab5739b3c4cdeae1de588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = f(x) [f(0)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />.    \nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d7793f0e973aa1f875ac4707c37834c3a6eb2a94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[f0)] \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/f/1ffbf99a50b9d9764f0843c1c48440dad7c9ba03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\frac{f(0)}{[f(0)]}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"106\" height=\"43\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is constant. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/691b8ed9474ce2bd48093b5c06c0d9cd831108de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />. Then substituting that in (1) we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/5/f9525d83386947b586f5abf38e68a7c8b95fabd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=c[c] \\Rightarrow c(1-[c])=0 \\Rightarrow c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"259\" height=\"18\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7decbf7aba841a2e7346dcf2ac08ca54e117ec8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[c]=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/691b8ed9474ce2bd48093b5c06c0d9cd831108de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/0/a80d7a3ca845e6cae14b9db710b64331219ec3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03eaf614e27ff65265ada4cd4348a2b5ab249706.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\in [1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6fec13f046ad56994eabd8ad3ec02629594d269.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[f(0)] = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82d0e714dd3855ef2e740b789ae984e1d7cd5f39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />.\nNow substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> we have   <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/153d39a03cd328633cfb538f754e6de8c51e0884.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)=f(1)[f(y)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />.\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/8/62814094593c3278388d97ed4bd5b1dc65774d98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/a/58af81556dda20ce198f12dac4227831a691a308.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[f(y)] = \\frac{f(y)}{f(1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"106\" height=\"43\" />  and substituting this in (1) we have   <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/d/e3d990ca4a158c3b950324f98381b6432dfb8cf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f([x]y)=\\frac{f(x)f(y)}{f(1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"151\" height=\"43\" />.\nThen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/4/8947c91ed36c468380c5270b38498d3f3e7fadae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f([x]y)=f(x[y])$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />.  \nSubstituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/d/8dda5c933cb588c1fe18bbab039b71f58e4b1bbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1/2, y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/2/6c2dbac772653b4e0edb32f774b271574b996cbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)=f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d358367015e5ceeb10a72c78d0b627d586f3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, which is a contradiction\nTherefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89d358367015e5ceeb10a72c78d0b627d586f3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />. and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b03d3bcd20efb1a34da217587701b882ff7e50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Then the only solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/c/a8c9cbf3e3c04dc46dea71f60acd0cb704eabc4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/691b8ed9474ce2bd48093b5c06c0d9cd831108de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03eaf614e27ff65265ada4cd4348a2b5ab249706.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\in [1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />.( By m.candales <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=35756&amp;\">[2]</a>)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec89f09c84538ec43930ca5d8e5e0957e2000822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/2/142922d96355bc83f0b95f57c1b748a9ca937d0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)=f(x)\\left\\lfloor f(0)\\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><b>Case 1</b>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/54181a3f7ccc11024494a502fe9f6e32c490b9c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor f(0)\\right\\rfloor\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/7/777140cab48d46a1a5b43070d4d4469f86378deb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\frac{f(0)}{\\left\\lfloor f(0)\\right\\rfloor}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"112\" height=\"43\" /> is a constant. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/9/1f9fd9b224fc95eea3afca7d2d56a384a898b34f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae08a03e2a764d92b73d3bfb1c07c86f9c7ec80d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=k\\left\\lfloor k \\right\\rfloor \\Leftrightarrow k=0 \\vee 1\\leq k&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"244\" height=\"20\" />. It is easy to check that this are solutions.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 2</b>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa674d0ea3c1c82bfca451d194e1af1747a6eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor f(0)\\right\\rfloor= 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>In this case we conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/d/d4d668bb86cdce0a5d7d8effc300a4e0a28f559d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor f(0)\\right\\rfloor= 0\\Rightarrow f(0)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"178\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Lemma\" title=\"Lemma\">Lemma</a>:If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/8/a28d01e29e434a45b8d39e0b64dab75d2639ce6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\leq f(y)&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b03d3bcd20efb1a34da217587701b882ff7e50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Proof_of_the_Lemma&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Proof of the Lemma (page does not exist)\">Proof of the Lemma</a>: If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/f/8bfaecef0ee9efcf5b8a649fe1fc9540e81aeddb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\left\\lfloor x\\right\\rfloor y)=f(y)=f(x)\\left\\lfloor f(y)\\right\\rfloor =0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"269\" height=\"19\" />, as desired.\n</p><p><br />\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/24539f4f4b2287d2ee3168d0aa658416dc2dc85e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\leq x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, so that we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef885f3849ab5851b1e076281f0eb1512e7365e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0=f(0)=f(\\left\\lfloor x\\right\\rfloor y)=f(x)\\left\\lfloor f(y)\\right\\rfloor\\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"292\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa826ce64ab634fd5e03e73484a66e80a6ead09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow f(x)=0 \\vee 0\\leq f(y)&lt;1 \\Rightarrow f(x)=0 \\vee f(y)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"18\" />, using the lemma.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is not constant and equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aa3f2787667463d24ff28a410330c2ec4f5953f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b40b9c14fcac6d31ec7ead87d961c16f618a617.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=0, \\forall 0\\leq x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNow it's enough to notice that any real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc396057fa790468d057dc505f6fc4ab973c58d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ky$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/8/dd82cdfcef7898bf957686658a842b569b7e00d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/e/ddec2407c10c1ff100a50c02def81b0b1838a6f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\leq y&lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a22e4bf3c4d08e0cf244217f13c6320e54165256.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=f(ky)=f(\\left\\lfloor k\\right\\rfloor y)=f(k)\\left\\lfloor f(y)\\right\\rfloor=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"340\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> was arbitrary, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is constant and equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nWe conclude that the solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/9/1f9fd9b224fc95eea3afca7d2d56a384a898b34f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/e/5be7cb12faa20d5e5b0a43c6c7bf2290060f48d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=0 \\vee 1\\leq k&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />.( By Jorge Miranda <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=45227&amp;\">[3]</a>\n)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd966b812477f41cead2dd35f7dfe3eeec194793.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\left\\lfloor x\\right\\rfloor y) = f(\\left\\lfloor \\lfloor x \\rfloor \\right\\rfloor y) = f(\\lfloor x \\rfloor)\\left\\lfloor f(y)\\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"295\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7df151daca0f722d67064a97f4c645de75bcfac0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(x) - f(\\lfloor x \\rfloor))\\left\\lfloor f(y)\\right\\rfloor = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"210\" height=\"19\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/b/39b5c9755a11dfd9dea1da1dcd236e268bad8675.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y\\in\\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/9/9890fcfb3263ed9cbc9aa4099f5c055673c29aaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor f(y)\\right\\rfloor = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"19\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/8/9e8ebec724dbdab77b1d340d590a6e3463e0a1f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\in \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, then by taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/f/2ff9892c490151d7ffb38d1b3d30d7a1a7cbc66f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)=f(1)\\left\\lfloor f(y)\\right\\rfloor = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"179\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is identically null (which checks).\n</p><p>If, contrariwise, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f944648ca0cdfbdfde1f50e33c0d1775ed320d40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor f(y_0)\\right\\rfloor \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"90\" height=\"19\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/b/e6bc0f981e6ec0b8f60bc389dcafef14af5f1956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_0 \\in \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, it follows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/5/1a55cef1243b30b9ec9ddae986e25d2c78bdcf77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = f(\\lfloor x \\rfloor)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"19\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/e/c0e43dc938faed17bbd60baac049bf2dd414cb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Now it immediately follows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/6479878c708d28248edb797b18eeba5fdca78556.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = f(\\lfloor x \\rfloor  \\cdot 1) = f(x)\\lfloor f(1) \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"240\" height=\"19\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b00980852a620cbd2f05577f3b2415a8372d52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)(1 - \\lfloor f(1) \\rfloor) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"164\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c521e90347340a01674ff83ad58dcbc5dec637d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"11\" /> this implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/d/b2d92bae73452ee7811694a53ad33ac36c0234c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor f(1) \\rfloor = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"82\" height=\"19\" />.\nAssume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a785a1195d1e8e304a828e3b472e212663cd979.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor f(0) \\rfloor=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"19\" />; then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/f/cdf35e631ac65b5128b92ab0bcf373cdd7fe2070.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq f(1) = f\\left ( 2\\cdot \\dfrac {1} {2} \\right ) = f(2)\\left \\lfloor f \\left ( \\dfrac {1} {2} \\right ) \\right \\rfloor = f(2)\\left \\lfloor f \\left ( \\left \\lfloor \\dfrac {1} {2} \\right \\rfloor \\right ) \\right \\rfloor = f(2)\\left \\lfloor f(0) \\right \\rfloor = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"602\" height=\"43\" />, absurd.\n</p><p>Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a15d3489239286ff30c337b196239ab02a1d556.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor f(0) \\rfloor \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"19\" />, and now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec89f09c84538ec43930ca5d8e5e0957e2000822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> in the given functional equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/5/885f4c3160b1714e46452879d0f91acc9bceb755.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = f(x)\\lfloor f(0) \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"19\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/e/c0e43dc938faed17bbd60baac049bf2dd414cb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/e/d1ef3e50712e6205529a8f897352c9e16ba25a4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = c \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" /> constant, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/9/389a3588e05c456834da9315179d939ef3012b20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor c \\rfloor = \\lfloor f(1) \\rfloor = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"19\" />, i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03eaf614e27ff65265ada4cd4348a2b5ab249706.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\in [1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> (which obviously checks).( By mavropnevma <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=64716&amp;\">[4]</a>)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d3957947b7cf845304689b05dc2d5c310027295.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y) = f(1) \\lfloor f(y) \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\" />. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, this implies\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/39783ec9c30ed1348d8e6e32979288ca536aff8c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(\\lfloor x \\rfloor y) = f(1) \\lfloor f(x) \\rfloor \\lfloor f(y) \\rfloor = f(x \\lfloor y \\rfloor)\\]\" width=\"305\" height=\"18\" />\nby symmetry. Setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff445e5990e2a19cc1e82936238848d016ef27bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1/2, y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\" /> here gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91a65f13ea1c56bed016806891be8341fd9d6fd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/a/afa1c26194076b1d160bb23ccfefdf1af99921a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/2/352bf528262bda9c78515a6860a8140d85dd558f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = f(x) \\lfloor f(0) \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"146\" height=\"20\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/8/b183cfd75200119df8130f2b91e45c167f941cf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/a/2ba2f98c5363b083d78e07960faf9f95f49dc9cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = c \\lfloor c \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"66\" height=\"20\" /> which implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03eaf614e27ff65265ada4cd4348a2b5ab249706.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\in [1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5061ac0ea7f3b0c9eb6387005ae6c28eac6bfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/7/d97677ebf8f0f0c9c47a21ff47767940a332315e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = f(1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"20\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/e/6ae1c3069613ea355a6ea6de2f31bcd9ff2f47e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y) = f(\\lfloor 1 \\rfloor y) = f(1) \\lfloor f(y) \\rfloor = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"263\" height=\"20\" />. So either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/7/677a39784c813b3a83884e7e6a9cc3ee89d099a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = c \\in [1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57ccf8d123ba4259e29fba55d9b008874e071492.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~not_detriti\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rY5YgNnVn7g\">https://youtu.be/rY5YgNnVn7g</a>  [Video Solution by little fermat]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO\" title=\"2010 IMO\">2010 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2010 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017223349\nCache expiry: 86400\nRe